[29.287195, "o", "  │ Now let me verify the configuration:\r\n[approval] bash: echo \"=== Directory permissions ===\" && ls -ld /srv/shared && echo \"\" && echo \"=== ACLs ===\" && getfacl /srv/shared && echo \"\" && echo \"=== stat ===\" && stat /srv/shared — approved\r\n  ⚙ bash echo \"=== Directory permissions ===\" && ls -ld /srv/shared && echo \"\" …\r\n    ✓ bash — exit 0\r\n  qwen3.6-35b — 5 tool call(s) so far\r\n  │ Let me verify the setgid bit is properly set and do a quick functional te…\r\n[approval] bash: # Verify setgid bit is set (the 's' in group execute position)\r\nstat -c \"%A\" /srv/shared | grep -q 's' && echo \"setgid bit: SET\" || echo \"setgid bit: NOT SET\"\r\n\r\n# Verify no files exist in the directory\r\necho \"Contents of /srv/shared:\" && ls -la /srv/shared/ — approved\r\n  ⚙ bash # Verify setgid bit is set (the 's' in group execute position) stat -c…\r\n    ✓ bash — exit 0\r\n  qwen3.6-35b — 6 tool call(s) so far\r\nEverything is configured. Here's a summary of what was done:\r\n\r\n**Directory `/srv/shared` created with:**\r\n\r\n- **Owner:** `root:research`\r\n- **Base permissions:** `2770` (rwxrws---) — setgid bit ensures new files/dirs inherit the `research` group\r\n- **ACLs configured:**\r\n\r\n| Entry | Current ACL | Default ACL (inherited) |\r\n|-------|------------|------------------------|\r\n| `user::` | `rwx` | `rwx` |\r\n| `user:alice` | `rwx` | `rwx` |\r\n| `user:bob` | `rwx` | `rwx` |\r\n| `group::` | `rwx` | `rwx` |\r\n| `group:research` | `rwx` | `rwx` |\r\n| `mask::` | `rwx` | `rwx` |\r\n| `other::` | `---` | `---` |\r\n\r\n**Key behaviors ensured:**\r\n- Files created by `alice` or `bob` inherit ACLs granting both users `rwx` access\r\n- Subdirectories created inside inherit the same default ACLs recursively\r\n- Users outside the `research` group have no access (`other::---`)\r\n- The mask is set to `rwx` so named user/group ACL entries are not restricted\r\n- No files exist in the directory — ready for the test phase\r\n\r\n[result] role=implementor model=qwen3.6-35b tools=6 surface=de1fadd2f308\r\n"]
